          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Helping Bake Business Better - London's number one rated corporate cupcakes and cakes with logos</h2><p>We’ve been helping companies just like yours with branded logo cupcakes and cakes for corporate events and gifting for over thirteen years! We know how busy you are, so we’ve made ordering EASY - you can even choose your flavours and upload your logo online.</p><p>Looking for something more involved? Colour matched icing? Bespoke designs for larger orders? Multiple timed-drops for press activations?</p><p>We're here to give you amazing fuss-free customer service, co-ordinate your logistics and make the whole experience seamless - Just email us at <a href=\"mailto:corporate@flavourtown.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">corporate@flavourtown.com</span></a> or call our corporate coordinator on 020 8108 5994.</p><p>The best brands in London choose Flavourtown for their corporate gifting - we make delicious deliveries of corporate cakes and cupcakes with logos every day of the week.</p>",
